                                            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">
                                                <i class="fas fa-info-circle mr-1"></i>
                                                <strong>Export your Excel as CSV first:</strong> File → Save As → CSV (Comma delimited). First row = headers.
                                            </p>
